{"id":"kolu-root","ord":"a0","title":"kolu — the terminal fleet","desc":"The project folder for github.com/juspay/kolu (local clone ~/code/kolu). Kolu lanes ride KOLU's own process (the ruling on Supervision's kolu-pr-process node): the author runs /be instead of our review round and /ci once at done; both platforms green before merge; the drishti pair opens whenever package exports change. Historical kolu lanes (dock-row, consumer-exports) live under the olai project's terminal-door item, where they were children of olai work.","created":"2026-08-28T16:52:15-04:00"}
{"id":"kolu-alert-49","parent":"kolu-root","ord":"a0","title":"Fix code-scanning alert 49: shell command built from environment","doing":true,"desc":"CodeQL js/shell-command-injection-from-environment (medium) at packages/padi/src/ports/scan.live.test.ts:67 — a shell command interpolates an environment-derived absolute path. The fix passes the path as spawn argv (satisfying CodeQL's dataflow, not just quoting), sweeping any sibling instances in touched code. Auto-merge on green CI, both platforms, per kolu's process.","created":"2026-08-28T16:52:15-04:00","custom":{"agent":"agent-pi","brief":"briefs/kolu-alert-49.md","dispatched":"2026-08-28T16:55:00-04:00","merge":"merge-auto","terminal":"98022f47","tier":"mechanical","worktree":".worktrees/fix-scan-alert-49"}}
